      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Ranking of the 12 most‑liquid issuers by predicted probability of a positive return over the next 5 calendar days (anchor = 2026‑08‑24 21:00 UTC).**\n\n| Rank | Asset (ticker) | Predicted probability |\n|------|----------------|-----------------------|\n| 1 | GIOR | 87.4 % |\n| 2 | STIO | 86.8 % |\n| 3 | KASI | 86.7 % |\n| 4 | SOUS | 82.8 % |\n| 5 | PEAX | 82.7 % |\n| 6 | CLOS | 82.3 % |\n| 7 | HARE | 80.7 % |\n| 8 | CLAE | 80.6 % |\n| 9 | TISL | 79.3 % |\n|10 | GIST | 72.5 % |\n|11 | VIAS | 69.9 % |\n|12 | PRAL | 68.1 % |\n\n*Anchor:* 2026‑08‑24 21:00 UTC (market‑close).\n*Horizon:* 5 calendar days (the template predicts a positive five‑session adjusted‑close return within this window).\n\n**Source:** Kumo Relational prediction (template `positive_return`) – evidence ID [1].\n\n**Limitations:** The model outputs probabilities, not certainties; the horizon is calendar days, not strictly trading sessions. All issuers and data are synthetic.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] NVIDIA Kumo prediction result — positive_return — evidence `hermes-receipt:573d63033797a50a1e1d5cf936c7f8579e890389cab454d5a9d8bf0775d45b6f`",
